{"strings":["Declaration","Details related to any statement or action, in any form prescribed or accepted by the Government Agency, giving information or particulars required by the Governmental Agency.","Message function code","Code specifying the function of a document.","In the WCO Data Model the API Document identifier is mapped to Message function, coded instead of using the Document reference number.\n\nThe combination of Document Name Code and Document Identifier Code will result in:\n745  CP  Change Passenger Data\n745  XR  Cancel Reservation\n745  RP  Reduction in Party \n266  CL  Flight Close (only) Flight Close w/ identified Passengers not on-board \n266  CLOB  Flight Close w/ identified Passengers on-board\n266  XF  Cancel Flight\n266  CF  Change Flight/Itinerary\n250  CL  Crew Flight Close (only)\n250  CLNB Crew Flight Close w/ identified Crew not on-board \n250  CLOB  Crew Flight Close w/ identified Crew on-board","DocumentFunctionCodeList","Functional identifier","Identification of a specific information exchange.","Document name code","Code specifying the name of a document.","*Note: A gate pass is an authorization for a non-travelling person to access the sterile area of airports for the purpose of accompanying a ticketed traveller. (Presently used only in the United States.)","UN/EDIFACT code list 1001 OR User code list","BorderTransportMeans","Details related to the means of transport crossing the border of the Customs territory.","Conveyance identifier","Identification of the journey of a means of transport, for example voyage number, flight number, trip number.","Itinerary","Details related to the itinerary of the means of transport.","To identify the arrival and departure airports relating to the specified flight. \nAirport codes are published in the IATA Airline Coding Directory","Itinerary location identifier","Identification of a single port of call or other location of the itinerary of a means of transport.","a2 in WCO Data Model","UN/LOCODE + User codes","Sequence number","Number indicating the position in a sequence.","Itinerary arrival date/time","Date and time of arrival at itinerary port of the means of transport.","The default format is ?YYMMDD? (n6) ?130628? \nOther format is ?YYMMDDHHMM? (n10).\n?1306281205'","Itinerary departure date/time","Date and time of departure at itinerary port of the means of transport.","Itinerary location type code","Code specifying the type of the itinerary location.","UN/EDIFACT code list 3227","PersonOnBoard","Details related to the person on board of a transport means.","DMR needed for Communication number(s) of the passenger?","AdditionalDocument","Details related to additional documents as part of a declaration or as part of a response.","Additional document identifier","Identification of a document providing additional information.","Additional document issuing date/time","Date and time of issuing an additional document and when needed, signed or otherwise authenticated.","Additional document issuing location name","Name of the location where a document was issued.","Additional document type code","Code specifying the type of an additional document.","Address","Details related to an address.","City name","Name of a city.","Country code","Code specifying the name of the country or other geographical entity as specified in ISO 3166 and UN/ECE Rec 3.","CountryCodeList","Country sub-entity identification code","Code specifying the name of a country subdivision.","Either a code in data element 3229 or a name in data element 3228","ISO 3166-2 OR User code list","Country sub-entity name","Name of a country subdivision.","Street and number/P.O. Box","Specification of the postal delivery point such as street and number or post office box.","Postcode identifier","Identification of the postal zone or address.","Only an..9 available in WCO Data Model","User code list","DisembarkationLocation","Details related to the disembarkation location.","Disembarkation location identifier","Identification of a port or location of disembarkation.","Effects","Details related to personal effects.","DMR needed for weight of the baggage","Sequential reference","Effects  identifier","Identification of the personal effects.","Effects description","Description of personal belongings in the possession of individual crew members or passengers which according to regulations in force at the location of arrival of a means of transport are dutiable or subject to prohibitions or restrictions.","Effects quantity","Quantity specifying the number of  personal belongings in the possession of individual crew members or passengers which according to regulations in force at the place of arrival of a means of transport are dutiable or subject to prohibitions or restrictions.","EmbarkationLocation","Details related to the embarkation location.","Embarkation location identifier","Identification of a port or location of embarkation.","PersonData","Details related to the person.","Family name","Family name of a person as mentioned in an official document.","Given name","Given name of a person as mentioned in an official document.","Job title","Job title or the rank of a person.","Nationality code","Code specifying the nationality of a person.","PersonNationalityCodeList","Birth date/time","Date and time an individual was born.","Birth location name","Name of the location where a person is or was born.","Gender code","Code specifying the gender of a person.","PersonGenderCodeList","Residence country code","Code specifying the country of residence of a person.","Traveller status code","Code specifying the status of a person on board.","DMR needed for Person on board type, code with code list 3035","PersonStatusCodeList","Information verified indicator","Indicator if the information is verified (boolean).","TravelDocument","Details related to the travel document (e.g. passport).","Document expiration date/time","Date and time of expiration of the document (e.g. license, visa, permit, certificate).","Travel document identifier","Identification of the travel document by number.","Travel document issuing country or political entity identifier","Identification of the country or political entity issuing the travel document.","UN/LOCODE","Travel document type code","Code specifying the name of a travel document.","TotalPersons","Details related to the total number of persons (e.g. passengers, crew).","Person type code","Code specifying the type of person (Crew, Passenger, Stowaway, etc.).","UN/EDIFACT code list 3035","Total number of persons","Quantity specifying the total number of persons (passengers and crew, including the captain/master) on board of a means of transport.","Carrier","Details related to the party undertaking or arranging transport of goods between named points.","Carrier identifier","Identification of a party providing the transport of goods between named points.","AF Over-flight\nDL","International codes (e.g. DUNS, EAN) OR User codes","Declarant","Details related to the party who makes a declaration to an official body or - where legally permitted - in whose name, or on whose behalf, a declaration to an official body is made.","This may either be an assigned profile or the name of the contact person","Declarant name","Name of the party who makes a declaration to an official body or - where legally permitted - in whose name, or on whose behalf, a declaration to an official body is made.","Used if profile has not been established\nContact Surname\nUsed if profile has not been established\nContact First Name","Declarant identifier","Identification of a party who makes a declaration to an official body or - where legally permitted - in whose name, or on whose behalf, a declaration to an official body is made.","Used if a Profile has been assigned","Communication","Details related to communication including number and number type.","Up to 3 communication numbers can be provided.\nData must be provided if no contact profile has been established.\n\nWhen reporting email addresses, special consideration should be give to any special characters appearing in the email address and potential impact to the syntax delimitation defined in the UNA segment","Communication identifier","Identification of the communication address.","Communication number type code","Code specifying the type of communication address.","CommunicationMeansTypeCodeList"],"root":{"s":"Declaration","n":0,"d":1,"t":"C","c":"","w":"42A","u":"0001D","q":"1","v":"https://vocabulary.wcoomd.org/Declaration","ub":["bri"],"src":"BIP DEC:4","k":[{"s":"function","n":2,"d":3,"t":"E","c":"0..1","x":"FunctionCode","f":"n..2","r":4,"w":"D046","u":"0001D","q":"6","v":"https://vocabulary.wcoomd.org/documentFunctionCode","l":"https://vocabulary.wcoomd.org/code-list/document-function-code-list","ln":5,"ub":["api","bri","msw","sad","upu"],"src":"BIP DEC:9"},{"s":"functionalReference","n":6,"d":7,"t":"E","c":"0..1","x":"FunctionalReferenceID","f":"an..70","w":"D026","u":"0001D","q":"7","v":"https://vocabulary.wcoomd.org/functionalReferenceIdentifier","ub":["api","bri","msw","sad"],"src":"BIP DEC:10"},{"s":"type","n":8,"d":9,"t":"E","c":"0..1","x":"TypeCode","f":"an..3","r":10,"w":"D013","u":"0001D","q":"14","v":"https://vocabulary.wcoomd.org/aipTypeCode","l":"https://vocabulary.wcoomd.org/code-list/external/un-edifact-code-list-1001-or-user-code-list","ln":11,"ub":["api","bri","msw","sad","upu"],"src":"BIP DEC:17"},{"s":"BorderTransportMeans","n":12,"d":13,"t":"C","c":"0..*","w":"15A","u":"0071D","q":"457","v":"https://vocabulary.wcoomd.org/BorderTransportMeans","ub":["bri"],"src":"BIP DEC:460","k":[{"s":"journey","n":14,"d":15,"t":"E","c":"0..1","x":"JourneyID","f":"an..17","w":"149","u":"0071D","q":"472","v":"https://vocabulary.wcoomd.org/journeyIdentifier","ub":["aei","api","bri"],"src":"BIP DEC:475"},{"s":"Itinerary","n":16,"d":17,"t":"C","c":"0..*","r":18,"w":"81A","u":"0100D","q":"638","v":"https://vocabulary.wcoomd.org/Itinerary","ub"